          "line": 35,
          "message": "This call passes execute into a helper. Name the executor inside the helper (`execute(sql`…`)`) instead of passing it. Analysis does not follow an executor passed as a value, so this call is not a judged rewrite. Write the SQL as an argument of that executor. Analysis cannot check SQL that only reaches the executor through a passed function.",
